[PROMPT ENGINEERING]
CATEGORY: STUDY
PRIORITY: HIGH
DEADLINE: 0-0-0

NOTES
THINGS TO CONSIDER WHEN GIVING PROMPTS TO AI
A. CLEAR INSTRUCTIONS
B. ADAPT A PERSONA(LIKE: I WANT YOU TO ACT LIKE THIS.. THAT..)
C. ADD FORMATTING(LIKE: ASK FOR FORMATTIG[BULLETS, CHECKLIST, TABLES,...])
        YOU CAN ALSO ASK THIS: LIMIT THE ANSWER TO N WORDS FOR SIMPLE AND CLEAN RESULTS

TYPES OF PROMPTING
A. ZERO-SHOT PROMPTING
- NO PRIOR DATA IS FED TO THE AI
- AI IS GETTING ZERO INFORMATION
- THIS IS DONE TO GET FACTUAL RESULTS AND PREDEFINED ANSWERS
- EG: WHAT IS THE CAPITAL CITY OF FRANCE? THIS QUESTION DOESN'T NEED PRIOR DATA TO BE FED.

B. FEW-SHOT PROMPTING
- AI IS TRAINED WITH FEW DATA BEFORE ASKING THE QUESTION
- EG: IF YOU WANT CHAT-GPT TO RECOMMEND YOU SOME RESTAURANT IN NEPAL, YOU MUST GIVE IT PRIOR INFORMATION LIKE YOUR FAVOURITE TYPES OF FOOD.

AI-HALLUCINATION
- THIS TERM MEANS GIVING WRONG OUTPUT BECAUSE OF MISINTERPRETATION OF DATA.

[/PROMPT ENGINEERING]